#. type: Title #
#: ../README.md:48
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Build"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../README.md:51
#, markdown-text
msgid "Stable installation:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:58
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    Clone the whole repo, then run `./configure`. Dependencies will be "
"detected automatically,\n"
"    please keep an eye on the output since components are automatically "
"disabled if not available.\n"
"    For documentation generation, you need `asciidoctor`. For multi-language "
"support, you need\n"
"    `gettext` package. For eBPF support, you need `libbpf` and "
"`bpftool`. You could use\n"
"    `--without-doc`, `--without-i18n` and `--without-ebpf` to disable them "
"explicitly.\n"
"    Please run `./configure --help` for more details.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:67
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```sh\n"
"    git clone https://github.com/ceccomp/ceccomp.git\n"
"    cd Ceccomp\n"
"    ./configure\n"
"    ./configure # run this again if Makefile is not generated\n"
"    make\n"
"    make install # install at /usr/local/bin\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../README.md:69
#, markdown-text
msgid "Testing installation:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:71
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "    Clone the whole repo, and then run `./configure --devmode`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:78
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```sh\n"
"    git clone https://github.com/ceccomp/ceccomp.git\n"
"    cd Ceccomp\n"
"    ./configure --devmode\n"
"    make\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:85
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> To build this project or enable some features, the lowest denpendency "
"version\n"
"> baselines are:\n"
"> * Linux >= 5.3, libseccomp >= 2.5.0 (exclude libbpf support)\n"
"> * Linux >= 5.11, libbpf >= 0.6.0 (global capture, only x86_64 "
"guaranteed)\n"
"> * Linux >= 6.2, libbpf >= 0.6.0 (capture pid)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: ../README.md:86
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run Test"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:90
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Run configure and make, then invoke `pytest test` from repo root. Trace pid "
"case will be skipped if no CAP_SYS_ADMIN. If you find some checks failed, "
"please submit an issue to report your case."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:93
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"To run the test, you need 2 extra packages: `pkgconf` (required by "
"`pkg-config`) and `python-pytest` (required by `pytest`)."
msgstr ""

